{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791029460, "covers_from": "2026-10-03T12:11:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-03T12:12:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791029520, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-03T12:11:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 56121, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北要有多一點平價簡單乾淨像日本商務旅館那樣的飯店，外國朋友抱怨很多次隨便不起眼老舊的飯店都3千以上", "display_name": "大安代表 No.56,121", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T12:11:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 56122, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "建請於北市幹道普及單車專用道，獨立劃分車道以實施人車分流，避免與汽機車及行人爭道，確保通行安全。", "display_name": "信義代表 No.56,122", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T12:11:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13979, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "文化", "content": "一直以來，台北市都是一個「首都」的高大上形象，然而歷任巿長不是缺乏重視就是不太在乎，希望沈伯洋能做到", "display_name": "士林代表 No.13,979", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T12:11:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13204, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "老屋翻新能增加誘因，尤其是越老的房子要誘因越大，缺乏電梯、結構安全是最令人擔憂的。", "display_name": "松山代表 No.13,204", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 56122, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.56,122", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 13979, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.13,979", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 13204, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.13,204", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 41038, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.41,038"